# Stockhunt repo-root ignores.
#
# The rule of thumb: track code, track findings, ignore anything a machine can
# rebuild. Price caches (1.7 GB) come back from Twelve Data via td_loader.py;
# the bulk sweep intermediates (~400 MB) come back by re-running the sweeps.
# Summaries, meta and curve JSONs ARE tracked -- they are the research record.

# --- environments ---
.venv/
# Per-engine environments for engine-bakeoff/ (see its README to recreate)
.venv-bakeoff/
# The paper trading engine runs on this one (nautilus_trader)
.venv-nautilus/

# --- Claude Code ---
# Session state is not project content, but settings.json IS: it carries the
# deny rules that lock "test research/" and "top 20 stocks/".
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json

# --- credentials, never commit ---
.env.local
*.env.local

# --- python ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/
scratchpad/
.DS_Store

# --- price data: regenerable, ~1.7 GB ---
/data/
test research/data/
top 20 stocks/data/
backtest master/data/
backtest engine/data/
engine-bakeoff/data_td/
# manifoldbt's Arrow store, rebuilt by run_manifoldbt.py on every run
engine-bakeoff/_mbt_store/
engine-bakeoff/_probe_store/

# --- bulk sweep intermediates: regenerable, ~400 MB ---
# Superseded manual backups from before the itemised fee model.
*.oldfees
# Per-fold and per-asset row dumps. The summaries beside them are tracked.
**/results/*folds*.csv
**/results/*schedule*.csv
**/results/combo_per_asset_*.csv

# --- the paper-trading record ---
# paper.db itself IS tracked: it is the forward-test record and the whole point of the
# store is that it is not lost. Only SQLite's transient sidecars are ignored.
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# --- run logs ---
**/logs/
*.log
*.err

# --- generated artifacts ---
# Built by build_report.py from template.html + report.js + the payload.
**/report/index.html
report_payload.json
# Built by the dashboard builder from the results CSVs.
**/web/data.js
**/web/live.json
**/web/paper_curves.json
**/web/curves/
**/dist/dashboard.html

# --- vendored binaries ---
# Cloudflare Tunnel, 52 MB. Download from github.com/cloudflare/cloudflared.
**/tools/cloudflared.exe
